(5498807, 793314, 30861, '<td valign="top">Helluva capture I Sure as heck hope that rainbow was really there :-) (Just kidding, I am sure it was. It''s a very nice shot. <br/> <br/>I''m not wild about the text effects in "Hilux", but what the heck... I just hope that all that texture effect on the type is actually legal, I wouldn''t have dared to do it based on the clipart rule. Also, I''m bugged by the way the border effect is different on the two opposite angles of the image...<br/> <br/>All in all I like it a lot, and it gets a 7 from me for now at least... Good luck!</td>', 'Helluva capture I Sure as heck hope that rainbow was really there :-) (Just kidding, I am sure it was. It''s a very nice shot.  I''m not wild about the text effects in "Hilux", but what the heck... I just hope that all that texture effect on the type is actually legal, I wouldn''t have dared to do it based on the clipart rule. Also, I''m bugged by the way the border effect is different on the two opposite angles of the image... All in all I like it a lot, and it gets a 7 from me for now at least... Good luck!', '2009-05-25 01:58:40.000000', NULL, 1),
