(5499303, 792374, 80167, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love the left side of this image. The color of the car fits nicely with the theme, but it still stands out from the sand. The object on the right is super distracting to me, though - and seems a tad over processed. Seriously, great work with the car, sky, sand, though!</td>', 'I absolutely love the left side of this image. The color of the car fits nicely with the theme, but it still stands out from the sand. The object on the right is super distracting to me, though - and seems a tad over processed. Seriously, great work with the car, sky, sand, though!', '2009-05-25 12:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
