(5499903, 793417, 96881, '<td valign="top">Way too much bright words for me.  The words overpower the image, the image is not great of the Limo, a bad angle and bad lighting, with plenty of distracting elements as well.  The car needed to be more evenly lit to make it the subject</td>', 'Way too much bright words for me.  The words overpower the image, the image is not great of the Limo, a bad angle and bad lighting, with plenty of distracting elements as well.  The car needed to be more evenly lit to make it the subject', '2009-05-25 23:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5499908, 793082, 96881, '<td valign="top">A typical Auto ad.....A very typical Audi Ad.  We executed and a brilliant location and sunset to allow you to pull this off.<br/>Maybe the car could be lit a little better.  Only a minor critisism and the only thing that differentiates this from the Ad that is in the magazine in front of me really.  An excelent challenge submission.</td>', 'A typical Auto ad.....A very typical Audi Ad.  We executed and a brilliant location and sunset to allow you to pull this off.Maybe the car could be lit a little better.  Only a minor critisism and the only thing that differentiates this from the Ad that is in the magazine in front of me really.  An excelent challenge submission.', '2009-05-25 23:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
