(5499988, 792692, 54645, '<td valign="top">This is fantastic. Gorgeous foal, love the curly hair! The ad screams Americana, although I''m not sure I understand the upper text. That said, the photograph is excellent.</td>', 'This is fantastic. Gorgeous foal, love the curly hair! The ad screams Americana, although I''m not sure I understand the upper text. That said, the photograph is excellent.', '2009-05-26 02:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5499989, 792872, 54645, '<td valign="top">Excellent concept. The surrounding environment is a perfect setting for this car. 8</td>', 'Excellent concept. The surrounding environment is a perfect setting for this car. 8', '2009-05-26 02:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5499990, 793361, 54645, '<td valign="top">Concept is good, as is the execution. The ad does not portray BMW if I can''t tell it''s a BMW. It does make want to go out and drive!</td>', 'Concept is good, as is the execution. The ad does not portray BMW if I can''t tell it''s a BMW. It does make want to go out and drive!', '2009-05-26 02:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5499991, 791991, 54645, '<td valign="top">Ha! I love the tag line limited time only! I also wonder how much longer we will be able to buy American!</td>', 'Ha! I love the tag line limited time only! I also wonder how much longer we will be able to buy American!', '2009-05-26 02:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5499995, 792308, 54645, '<td valign="top">I like the photograph. I''m not sure if it meets the criteria of an automobile ad! I''ll take it thought. It is a conveyor of passengers! ;)</td>', 'I like the photograph. I''m not sure if it meets the criteria of an automobile ad! I''ll take it thought. It is a conveyor of passengers! ;)', '2009-05-26 02:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500059, 793289, 103032, '<td valign="top">Composition is off (for me).  In general, I think it would have worked better to compose the BMW more to the left, going into the frame vs leaving the frame.  I''m sure it was an artistic decision to have the sun directly in the background, but I think it hurts more than helps the image.  It creates glare that detracts from the vehicle.  But thats just my opinion.</td>', 'Composition is off (for me).  In general, I think it would have worked better to compose the BMW more to the left, going into the frame vs leaving the frame.  I''m sure it was an artistic decision to have the sun directly in the background, but I think it hurts more than helps the image.  It creates glare that detracts from the vehicle.  But thats just my opinion.', '2009-05-26 07:08:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500060, 793361, 103032, '<td valign="top">Great motion, but not enough car.  Image needs more of the car and someway to show its a BMW.  As is, the only thing that the average viewer can tell its a BMW is the title.  IMHO.</td>', 'Great motion, but not enough car.  Image needs more of the car and someway to show its a BMW.  As is, the only thing that the average viewer can tell its a BMW is the title.  IMHO.', '2009-05-26 07:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500061, 793377, 18450, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colours and dof. Good work!!</td>', 'Beautiful colours and dof. Good work!!', '2009-05-26 07:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500062, 792671, 18450, '<td valign="top">LOL I love it!!</td>', 'LOL I love it!!', '2009-05-26 07:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500063, 792513, 18450, '<td valign="top">Superb shot!!!</td>', 'Superb shot!!!', '2009-05-26 07:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500064, 792374, 103032, '<td valign="top">I personally don''t get the tag line, but I''m not judging the tag line or font.  With that said, I do like how you placed the text over and under the vehicle.  This technique further draws the viewer''s attention to the vehicle.  Nice job there.  I like the composition, the vehicle looks nicely focused.  In my opinion, I like the "balance" of the image with the shipwreck, the vehicle and dunes and even the sky.  I think the clouds give the sky "balance" to the ship.  I think this is nicely done.</td>', 'I personally don''t get the tag line, but I''m not judging the tag line or font.  With that said, I do like how you placed the text over and under the vehicle.  This technique further draws the viewer''s attention to the vehicle.  Nice job there.  I like the composition, the vehicle looks nicely focused.  In my opinion, I like the "balance" of the image with the shipwreck, the vehicle and dunes and even the sky.  I think the clouds give the sky "balance" to the ship.  I think this is nicely done.', '2009-05-26 07:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500067, 793423, 103032, '<td valign="top">Personally, it would have worked better for me if it wasn''t flipped upside down, and left right side up.  For me the distortion of the reflection (top right of the image) is distracting and "plays visual tricks" with the viewer, where my first reaction is "what''s wrong with this picture" vs left right side up, my first reaction would be "wow, he/she has an almost perfect reflection."  But that''s just my humble opinion.  Good luck.</td>', 'Personally, it would have worked better for me if it wasn''t flipped upside down, and left right side up.  For me the distortion of the reflection (top right of the image) is distracting and "plays visual tricks" with the viewer, where my first reaction is "what''s wrong with this picture" vs left right side up, my first reaction would be "wow, he/she has an almost perfect reflection."  But that''s just my humble opinion.  Good luck.', '2009-05-26 07:38:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500068, 793082, 103032, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed.  Focus is crisp.  Nice setting, nice background colors that adds to the "mood" if you will.  Pro like image.  Well done.</td>', 'Nicely composed.  Focus is crisp.  Nice setting, nice background colors that adds to the "mood" if you will.  Pro like image.  Well done.', '2009-05-26 07:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500069, 793366, 103032, '<td valign="top">On a technical critique, the image has an overall fuzziness, even the text.  Maybe something happened on the resizing or uploading???  Looks like quite a bit of noise too...</td>', 'On a technical critique, the image has an overall fuzziness, even the text.  Maybe something happened on the resizing or uploading???  Looks like quite a bit of noise too...', '2009-05-26 07:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500076, 792805, 103032, '<td valign="top">Kind of looks slightly out of focus, or intentionally soft focused?  The car actually looks like a model of Bel Air?????  The wing window frame doesn''t look quite right, the side molding looks "fat", door handles don''t look right.</td>', 'Kind of looks slightly out of focus, or intentionally soft focused?  The car actually looks like a model of Bel Air?????  The wing window frame doesn''t look quite right, the side molding looks "fat", door handles don''t look right.', '2009-05-26 08:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500077, 792513, 103032, '<td valign="top">Compared to a similar image, I think this is nicely done.  Nice conveyance of motion, and nice POV helps the viewer visualize being in the car and "experiencing the ultimate driving machine."  Well done.</td>', 'Compared to a similar image, I think this is nicely done.  Nice conveyance of motion, and nice POV helps the viewer visualize being in the car and "experiencing the ultimate driving machine."  Well done.', '2009-05-26 08:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500078, 793410, 103032, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I like the blur of the pavement to show motion.  Composition is perfect.  The only thing I would like is for the front end to be lightened a touch to see a little more detail of the front end.   I just noticed the perpendicular lines on the pavement; shot in a parking lot?  I won''t hold that against you  :)   Well done image.</td>', 'Nice shot.  I like the blur of the pavement to show motion.  Composition is perfect.  The only thing I would like is for the front end to be lightened a touch to see a little more detail of the front end.   I just noticed the perpendicular lines on the pavement; shot in a parking lot?  I won''t hold that against you  :)   Well done image.', '2009-05-26 08:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500079, 792762, 103032, '<td valign="top">Nice point of view, nice setting.</td>', 'Nice point of view, nice setting.', '2009-05-26 08:08:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500080, 793432, 103032, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, the Cruiser is crisp, the blue stands out from the surroundings/background.  The setting is perfect for the vehicle.  Good use of rule of thirds.  Well done.</td>', 'Nice shot, the Cruiser is crisp, the blue stands out from the surroundings/background.  The setting is perfect for the vehicle.  Good use of rule of thirds.  Well done.', '2009-05-26 08:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
