(5500374, 793061, 50034, '<td valign="top">Inticingly to the Point!<br/> <br/>However, if you had cropped just above the two distractions in the lower left-hand corner, I believe that it would score a few tenths of a point higher over-all.  (Yet, THAT is merely a judgment-call and personal experience on DPC.)<br/> <br/>Also, the slight black marks on the gray foot-cover could cost a few quality points.  (I have actually improved my ability to clone, to smudge, and to use spot-healing brushes...ALL due to loss of quality points on DPC...with very similar issues.)  <br/> <br/>However, this is a truck that is "Lived-In," so I will now score you slightly higher than usual to compensate.  Been There!  Done That!  Living the Sequel!  :}</td>', 'Inticingly to the Point! However, if you had cropped just above the two distractions in the lower left-hand corner, I believe that it would score a few tenths of a point higher over-all.  (Yet, THAT is merely a judgment-call and personal experience on DPC.) Also, the slight black marks on the gray foot-cover could cost a few quality points.  (I have actually improved my ability to clone, to smudge, and to use spot-healing brushes...ALL due to loss of quality points on DPC...with very similar issues.)   However, this is a truck that is "Lived-In," so I will now score you slightly higher than usual to compensate.  Been There!  Done That!  Living the Sequel!  :}', '2009-05-26 12:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500410, 793097, 67152, '<td valign="top">love the feel and look of the image - the colors and details are outstnading - not crazy about the font choice but that is a personal taste thing - not voting</td>', 'love the feel and look of the image - the colors and details are outstnading - not crazy about the font choice but that is a personal taste thing - not voting', '2009-05-26 13:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
