(5500420, 793428, 67152, '<td valign="top">love the processing and the text added is very introspective - a nice sentiment so many are feeling right now - not voting but good image</td>', 'love the processing and the text added is very introspective - a nice sentiment so many are feeling right now - not voting but good image', '2009-05-26 13:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500425, 793448, 67152, '<td valign="top">i like the head-on take - saab has a very distinct front end.  But without the lower bumper it seems missing something (i understand that you were hiding the plate - but coudl you have taken it off?).  I think there is a bit too much border for this image, especially with 1/3 of the bottom taken up by border - not voting</td>', 'i like the head-on take - saab has a very distinct front end.  But without the lower bumper it seems missing something (i understand that you were hiding the plate - but coudl you have taken it off?).  I think there is a bit too much border for this image, especially with 1/3 of the bottom taken up by border - not voting', '2009-05-26 13:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500428, 793411, 67152, '<td valign="top">i really like the lines created by the bridge above - the smoky/foggy feel works nicely for mood - i just wonder if a bit of light on the car to bring out a bit more of the lines would have even worked better - not voting but good image</td>', 'i really like the lines created by the bridge above - the smoky/foggy feel works nicely for mood - i just wonder if a bit of light on the car to bring out a bit more of the lines would have even worked better - not voting but good image', '2009-05-26 13:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500434, 793366, 67152, '<td valign="top">funny slogan  - decent use of red border to emphasize the lettering on the nameplate - i just wish the image were a bit sharper in focus - not voting</td>', 'funny slogan  - decent use of red border to emphasize the lettering on the nameplate - i just wish the image were a bit sharper in focus - not voting', '2009-05-26 13:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500440, 792671, 67152, '<td valign="top">very funny entry....i like the stockings especially - that is a great touch....just stopped in for a comment</td>', 'very funny entry....i like the stockings especially - that is a great touch....just stopped in for a comment', '2009-05-26 13:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500442, 793049, 67152, '<td valign="top">nice effort to hit the challenge description - i think it is a great newspaper advert - it has all the direct local appeal that so many paper ads use - not voting</td>', 'nice effort to hit the challenge description - i think it is a great newspaper advert - it has all the direct local appeal that so many paper ads use - not voting', '2009-05-26 13:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500445, 793376, 67152, '<td valign="top">lovely the colors and the sunset behind - really well positioned shot -  but I don''t understand the wonderbike thing - its a car not a bike....not voting</td>', 'lovely the colors and the sunset behind - really well positioned shot -  but I don''t understand the wonderbike thing - its a car not a bike....not voting', '2009-05-26 13:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500450, 793385, 67152, '<td valign="top">an interesting take on the challenge - i just would have thought that the martian technology would include levitation and some cool flashy lights...</td>', 'an interesting take on the challenge - i just would have thought that the martian technology would include levitation and some cool flashy lights...', '2009-05-26 13:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500451, 793061, 67152, '<td valign="top">i really like the slogan - very clever - i just wonder if being able to see a bit more of the truck so we could tell it is a truck would have helped you ''deliver'' the concept even better</td>', 'i really like the slogan - very clever - i just wonder if being able to see a bit more of the truck so we could tell it is a truck would have helped you ''deliver'' the concept even better', '2009-05-26 13:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500453, 793169, 67152, '<td valign="top">the light streaming in, the angle of the road pulling us in, the rich saturated colors - very glossy indeed - i really like this one</td>', 'the light streaming in, the angle of the road pulling us in, the rich saturated colors - very glossy indeed - i really like this one', '2009-05-26 13:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500455, 793438, 67152, '<td valign="top">excellent entry - very cool use of ''macro'' style to deliver a concept - i can almost see VW using this type of advert</td>', 'excellent entry - very cool use of ''macro'' style to deliver a concept - i can almost see VW using this type of advert', '2009-05-26 13:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500465, 793430, 67152, '<td valign="top">great ''attitude'' shot - the triumphant fist bump is a great ''now'' touch<br/> <br/>I think your choice of use quotation marks makes this feel less ''real ad'' and more recreating an ad.  I would have lost the quotes for your slogan.  It is a great slogan and i think it would be okay to borrow it (if it isn''t yours) and give it the appropriate props in the comments section of your entry<br/> <br/>a good entry in this challenge</td>', 'great ''attitude'' shot - the triumphant fist bump is a great ''now'' touch I think your choice of use quotation marks makes this feel less ''real ad'' and more recreating an ad.  I would have lost the quotes for your slogan.  It is a great slogan and i think it would be okay to borrow it (if it isn''t yours) and give it the appropriate props in the comments section of your entry a good entry in this challenge', '2009-05-26 13:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500467, 793361, 67152, '<td valign="top">the feel of motion is clearly there and you picked a great slogan to fit it - not voting</td>', 'the feel of motion is clearly there and you picked a great slogan to fit it - not voting', '2009-05-26 13:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500474, 793172, 67152, '<td valign="top">what a great front end this car has - i love the choice of bright and cheery here - and the slight angle is excellent - straight on and flat would have been just that! <br/> <br/>I don''t quite understand the slogan but I do like the text at the bottom to balance the text above</td>', 'what a great front end this car has - i love the choice of bright and cheery here - and the slight angle is excellent - straight on and flat would have been just that!  I don''t quite understand the slogan but I do like the text at the bottom to balance the text above', '2009-05-26 13:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500478, 793374, 67152, '<td valign="top">i like how the lights of Times Square seem to give this an almost lightning like appearance - the choice of wide angle does give the car a bit of distorted look but i think it works okay here</td>', 'i like how the lights of Times Square seem to give this an almost lightning like appearance - the choice of wide angle does give the car a bit of distorted look but i think it works okay here', '2009-05-26 13:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500485, 793202, 67152, '<td valign="top">i love the grill on these badboys - so very cool - i just wish the dust and road stuff could have been cloned out or cleaned off so it looked even more shiny - i quite like this shot</td>', 'i love the grill on these badboys - so very cool - i just wish the dust and road stuff could have been cloned out or cleaned off so it looked even more shiny - i quite like this shot', '2009-05-26 13:54:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500495, 792308, 67152, '<td valign="top">A really nice entry - very cool lighting and background - the theme and the slogan are outstanding - i am sure you are going to be pounded by the DNMC police for not being a car - but I think it a great entry</td>', 'A really nice entry - very cool lighting and background - the theme and the slogan are outstanding - i am sure you are going to be pounded by the DNMC police for not being a car - but I think it a great entry', '2009-05-26 14:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500496, 793339, 67152, '<td valign="top">clearly out of the box - it does seem that the ad seems more about the people than the car - but i guess that is the point here....</td>', 'clearly out of the box - it does seem that the ad seems more about the people than the car - but i guess that is the point here....', '2009-05-26 14:03:10.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5500517, 793299, 67152, '<td valign="top">those things can go just about anywhere -and you captured the feel of what these cool vehicles can do</td>', 'those things can go just about anywhere -and you captured the feel of what these cool vehicles can do', '2009-05-26 14:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500522, 792960, 67152, '<td valign="top">i really like the shiny and high contrast treatment here - very glossy and dramatic - the couple in the upper right is a nice touch<br/> <br/>i wonder if white text at the bottom instead of the black text on the bumper would have even worked better...</td>', 'i really like the shiny and high contrast treatment here - very glossy and dramatic - the couple in the upper right is a nice touch i wonder if white text at the bottom instead of the black text on the bumper would have even worked better...', '2009-05-26 14:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500525, 793289, 67152, '<td valign="top">a great slogan, lovely warm and rich set of tones throughout<br/> <br/>i just wonder about the reflection on the paint on the doors - it seems to distract a bit - maybe you should have gotten it a bit dirtier...;-)</td>', 'a great slogan, lovely warm and rich set of tones throughout i just wonder about the reflection on the paint on the doors - it seems to distract a bit - maybe you should have gotten it a bit dirtier...;-)', '2009-05-26 14:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500543, 792087, 88247, '<td valign="top">Great Ad.<br/>My favourite of favourites in this challenge.<br/> <br/>Good luck.</td>', 'Great Ad.My favourite of favourites in this challenge. Good luck.', '2009-05-26 14:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500574, 792762, 66515, '<td valign="top">Nice but the text should tell me what car this! :)</td>', 'Nice but the text should tell me what car this! :)', '2009-05-26 15:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500581, 793061, 66515, '<td valign="top">not really an ad in my opinion.</td>', 'not really an ad in my opinion.', '2009-05-26 15:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500683, 792818, 67152, '<td valign="top">love this quirky capture - that longing for something beyond or unrealistic or unneeded</td>', 'love this quirky capture - that longing for something beyond or unrealistic or unneeded', '2009-05-26 17:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500684, 793447, 67152, '<td valign="top">a sweet ride - i love the guy behind the wheel - has he been in the car since it was made?<br/> <br/>the image itself has a bit of that 1950''s early 1960''s advert look - placing the car in a familiar spot with people in the car<br/> <br/>a nice job overall</td>', 'a sweet ride - i love the guy behind the wheel - has he been in the car since it was made? the image itself has a bit of that 1950''s early 1960''s advert look - placing the car in a familiar spot with people in the car a nice job overall', '2009-05-26 17:15:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500686, 792741, 67152, '<td valign="top">a very punny entry.  the image itself has all that you want - sharp, intense colors, interesting location.  the slogan has a great appeal to those that like word games.  i am just not fond of the choice of font - it seems too busy, especially with all the fonts and colors.  I think a simpler font design would have looked a bit more polished</td>', 'a very punny entry.  the image itself has all that you want - sharp, intense colors, interesting location.  the slogan has a great appeal to those that like word games.  i am just not fond of the choice of font - it seems too busy, especially with all the fonts and colors.  I think a simpler font design would have looked a bit more polished', '2009-05-26 17:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500688, 793424, 67152, '<td valign="top">i love the look of these cars - nice capture to get one going - too bad the passenger''s hair is getting thrown around so - it seems to distract more than aid to the ad.  good photo overall<br/> <br/>i am not fond of the font choice  - it seems a bit heavy and overwhelms the car a bit</td>', 'i love the look of these cars - nice capture to get one going - too bad the passenger''s hair is getting thrown around so - it seems to distract more than aid to the ad.  good photo overall i am not fond of the font choice  - it seems a bit heavy and overwhelms the car a bit', '2009-05-26 17:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500689, 792805, 67152, '<td valign="top">Love the effort to create that classic 1950s advert style.  the rich glossy finish, the high intensity lighting - very nice job</td>', 'Love the effort to create that classic 1950s advert style.  the rich glossy finish, the high intensity lighting - very nice job', '2009-05-26 17:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500690, 793352, 67152, '<td valign="top">i love the simplicity of this entry - it has the understated elegance of the top of the line car makers</td>', 'i love the simplicity of this entry - it has the understated elegance of the top of the line car makers', '2009-05-26 17:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500693, 791991, 67152, '<td valign="top">a novel approach to this challenge - it meets the criteria well IMO, even without showing a car.  I do think that the theme is a bit heavyhanded.  As an advert, I think ''Buy American'' and giving a positive spin about freedom etc might not seem so bleak and might do a better job of making people want to buy American.</td>', 'a novel approach to this challenge - it meets the criteria well IMO, even without showing a car.  I do think that the theme is a bit heavyhanded.  As an advert, I think ''Buy American'' and giving a positive spin about freedom etc might not seem so bleak and might do a better job of making people want to buy American.', '2009-05-26 17:23:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500694, 793329, 67152, '<td valign="top">Nice high contrast take on this - the lighting is outstanding and the image really delivers - good work</td>', 'Nice high contrast take on this - the lighting is outstanding and the image really delivers - good work', '2009-05-26 17:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500698, 793392, 67152, '<td valign="top">really nice work on the image - it has that glossy feel that really speaks advertisement.  <br/> <br/>i just don''t like the use of quotation marks at all.  They seem a bit unnecessary.  When I see quotes, I want to see who is being quoted.  Here you are advertising something...if you are quoting Motor Trend or some other award - then quotes make sense....sorry just a bit of a nit-pick!</td>', 'really nice work on the image - it has that glossy feel that really speaks advertisement.   i just don''t like the use of quotation marks at all.  They seem a bit unnecessary.  When I see quotes, I want to see who is being quoted.  Here you are advertising something...if you are quoting Motor Trend or some other award - then quotes make sense....sorry just a bit of a nit-pick!', '2009-05-26 17:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5500699, 793245, 67152, '<td valign="top">i love how this guy just overwhelms us with intense color, dramatic styling and glossy appeal - nice work</td>', 'i love how this guy just overwhelms us with intense color, dramatic styling and glossy appeal - nice work', '2009-05-26 17:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
