(5501621, 793411, 101117, '<td valign="top">This would make a great ad for a bodyshop or parts place. The location and the fog in the headlights work very well, as well as the strong red from the lights. 9 from me.</td>', 'This would make a great ad for a bodyshop or parts place. The location and the fog in the headlights work very well, as well as the strong red from the lights. 9 from me.', '2009-05-27 08:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
