(5501638, 793323, 101117, '<td valign="top">Good exposure and location, like the message you''re putting across as well.<br/> <br/>The shot seems a little flat though, it could be there there''s a lot of grey in it and it all seems to blend together, but it just doesn''t jump out the way you expect a car ad to do. 7 from me.</td>', 'Good exposure and location, like the message you''re putting across as well. The shot seems a little flat though, it could be there there''s a lot of grey in it and it all seems to blend together, but it just doesn''t jump out the way you expect a car ad to do. 7 from me.', '2009-05-27 08:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
