(5503216, 792280, 47470, '<td valign="top">The saying at the top is great (props if you made it up yourself!), but I think the image would have looked a bit more bold with a less distracting background, particularly on the right.  Maybe blur out the background?  It might look cool with a gradient blur so it looks like an incredibly shallow depth of field.</td>', 'The saying at the top is great (props if you made it up yourself!), but I think the image would have looked a bit more bold with a less distracting background, particularly on the right.  Maybe blur out the background?  It might look cool with a gradient blur so it looks like an incredibly shallow depth of field.', '2009-05-28 03:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
