(5505616, 793387, 73235, '<td valign="top">If you''re looking at Auto Ads, you can always see the driver through the windshield - thanks to polarizers :) I would have like to see some more surrounding of the car.</td>', 'If you''re looking at Auto Ads, you can always see the driver through the windshield - thanks to polarizers :) I would have like to see some more surrounding of the car.', '2009-05-30 11:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5505618, 792818, 73235, '<td valign="top">a real head turned, isn''t it? GReat interpretation of this challenge, showing the reaction of someone, rather the car itself.</td>', 'a real head turned, isn''t it? GReat interpretation of this challenge, showing the reaction of someone, rather the car itself.', '2009-05-30 11:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5505621, 793339, 73235, '<td valign="top">Sorry but I can hardly take this as an ad for a new car. Showing someone in an emergancy situation (broken down) is hardly a commercial for a new car. But I can see your line of thinking. You also get credit for getting lower to take a shot. Overall the photo is not very pleaseing to look at.</td>', 'Sorry but I can hardly take this as an ad for a new car. Showing someone in an emergancy situation (broken down) is hardly a commercial for a new car. But I can see your line of thinking. You also get credit for getting lower to take a shot. Overall the photo is not very pleaseing to look at.', '2009-05-30 11:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5505623, 792741, 73235, '<td valign="top">works well, strong contrast, bold colors support your message</td>', 'works well, strong contrast, bold colors support your message', '2009-05-30 11:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
