(5505630, 793163, 73235, '<td valign="top">my first impresssion: busy and WB off (whites are not white). A little more light been brought to the car might have helped. There is not much impact that want s me to stay longer and explore or even better: looking to find a car so I can buy it.</td>', 'my first impresssion: busy and WB off (whites are not white). A little more light been brought to the car might have helped. There is not much impact that want s me to stay longer and explore or even better: looking to find a car so I can buy it.', '2009-05-30 11:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5505632, 792280, 73235, '<td valign="top">now that''s a car ad. bold as the tile and text promises. a thought thru photo. well done</td>', 'now that''s a car ad. bold as the tile and text promises. a thought thru photo. well done', '2009-05-30 12:01:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5505638, 793376, 73235, '<td valign="top">from my son: that''s a cool picture :) guess that''s it then</td>', 'from my son: that''s a cool picture :) guess that''s it then', '2009-05-30 12:06:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5505643, 793323, 73235, '<td valign="top">good idea for the theme. just an extension of your thought: wouldn''t it been better to show the car moving? rather than standing still? You''re implying that you get get to places at this consumtion. But you''re showing a car stinding still with no implied action, like doing something at the lake in be background (fishing, relaxing,...)</td>', 'good idea for the theme. just an extension of your thought: wouldn''t it been better to show the car moving? rather than standing still? You''re implying that you get get to places at this consumtion. But you''re showing a car stinding still with no implied action, like doing something at the lake in be background (fishing, relaxing,...)', '2009-05-30 12:12:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5505645, 792805, 73235, '<td valign="top">Sorry but it''s too obvious it''s a model car. the DOF is too shallow with the focus on the windshield not the more intersting part - the front.</td>', 'Sorry but it''s too obvious it''s a model car. the DOF is too shallow with the focus on the windshield not the more intersting part - the front.', '2009-05-30 12:14:06.000000', NULL, 1),
