(5505658, 793366, 73235, '<td valign="top">I like the idea behind this photo. <br/>May I make some suggestions on the execution?<br/>- the subject is not clean<br/>- you can see the shadow thrown by the sun (diffuser could help with that)<br/>- the reflections on the crome parts are not coltrolled (a white background, like a paper board)<br/>- the DOF is not putting everything in focus (only the middle part)</td>', 'I like the idea behind this photo. May I make some suggestions on the execution?- the subject is not clean- you can see the shadow thrown by the sun (diffuser could help with that)- the reflections on the crome parts are not coltrolled (a white background, like a paper board)- the DOF is not putting everything in focus (only the middle part)', '2009-05-30 12:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5505662, 792374, 73235, '<td valign="top">good composition, what is that thing on the right side?</td>', 'good composition, what is that thing on the right side?', '2009-05-30 12:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5505666, 793410, 73235, '<td valign="top">very well done: motion blur, car in focus, a little reflection of the sky in the windshield, still being able to see the driver, bold colors. all of that creates an emotion of races and speed. well done</td>', 'very well done: motion blur, car in focus, a little reflection of the sky in the windshield, still being able to see the driver, bold colors. all of that creates an emotion of races and speed. well done', '2009-05-30 12:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5505670, 793438, 73235, '<td valign="top">unique take and interpretation. love the high contrast and details. good idea to include the partial light.</td>', 'unique take and interpretation. love the high contrast and details. good idea to include the partial light.', '2009-05-30 12:31:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5505673, 793426, 73235, '<td valign="top">a classic automotive ad, well done. the timing is very good with no interruption of the greem band in the middle.</td>', 'a classic automotive ad, well done. the timing is very good with no interruption of the greem band in the middle.', '2009-05-30 12:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5505687, 793380, 73235, '<td valign="top">I like the tilted horizon in combination with the curve. good bold colors.<br/>a little soft, but that''s ok as the pic is taken while driving.</td>', 'I like the tilted horizon in combination with the curve. good bold colors.a little soft, but that''s ok as the pic is taken while driving.', '2009-05-30 12:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
