(5505695, 793352, 73235, '<td valign="top">my first impression: WOW, then a few little things started grabbing my attention:<br/>- you blurred the reflections on the hood, right? check the edges - artifacts remain and show the "fiddling" with the photo<br/>- the blue ins the logo is too washed out.<br/> <br/>I still like the concept of your shot. PP let you down.</td>', 'my first impression: WOW, then a few little things started grabbing my attention:- you blurred the reflections on the hood, right? check the edges - artifacts remain and show the "fiddling" with the photo- the blue ins the logo is too washed out. I still like the concept of your shot. PP let you down.', '2009-05-30 12:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
