(5505763, 793299, 73235, '<td valign="top">Sorry to say but there is nothing really making me stay and explore more details in this picture. I think I can see the leading ines of the car into the picture, but I can''t help - they are leading me out onto the ocean, away from the car. THe car becomes an accessory, a means to get the viewer to look to the horizon. Guess it''s not an effect you where looking for, right?</td>', 'Sorry to say but there is nothing really making me stay and explore more details in this picture. I think I can see the leading ines of the car into the picture, but I can''t help - they are leading me out onto the ocean, away from the car. THe car becomes an accessory, a means to get the viewer to look to the horizon. Guess it''s not an effect you where looking for, right?', '2009-05-30 14:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
