(5506565, 793410, 100106, '<td valign="top">Well captured shot! Good focus on the car and the road looks great. Also, like your slogan. Nice touch.</td>', 'Well captured shot! Good focus on the car and the road looks great. Also, like your slogan. Nice touch.', '2009-05-31 14:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5506570, 793082, 100106, '<td valign="top">Excellent work here. From a commercial standpoint, it''s great. Such a eye popping image. Someone looking through a magazine would stop and look at this. The sky (IMO) doesn''t pull me away from the car. It''s just added eye candy that boost the car and helps achieve the respect factor. Color, focus, composition and placment of the text work for me. 10</td>', 'Excellent work here. From a commercial standpoint, it''s great. Such a eye popping image. Someone looking through a magazine would stop and look at this. The sky (IMO) doesn''t pull me away from the car. It''s just added eye candy that boost the car and helps achieve the respect factor. Color, focus, composition and placment of the text work for me. 10', '2009-05-31 14:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5506575, 792872, 100106, '<td valign="top">Stunning and full too the rim with wow factor. Love the BG you chose and the text that goes along with it. Perfect! The Car is on a great angle and the font works so well. Your lines are sharp but soft to give that luxury look. One of the best in the challenge IMO.</td>', 'Stunning and full too the rim with wow factor. Love the BG you chose and the text that goes along with it. Perfect! The Car is on a great angle and the font works so well. Your lines are sharp but soft to give that luxury look. One of the best in the challenge IMO.', '2009-05-31 14:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5506576, 793430, 100106, '<td valign="top">A well executed shot. You did a nice job giving the photo an overall rugged look. You captured the "Jeep" feel and idea hands down (IMO). Plus, I do enjoy the two about to fist five above the jeep. A nice touch. Good luck! 8</td>', 'A well executed shot. You did a nice job giving the photo an overall rugged look. You captured the "Jeep" feel and idea hands down (IMO). Plus, I do enjoy the two about to fist five above the jeep. A nice touch. Good luck! 8', '2009-05-31 14:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5506579, 792692, 100106, '<td valign="top">Such a creative idea and slogan. The truck pops really well to me. I like this because the Horses didn''t pull me away from seeing the truck first. Once they hit, it just pulls it all together.</td>', 'Such a creative idea and slogan. The truck pops really well to me. I like this because the Horses didn''t pull me away from seeing the truck first. Once they hit, it just pulls it all together.', '2009-05-31 14:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5506581, 793432, 100106, '<td valign="top">Really like the reflection of the woods on the side. Good angle and it conveys the "off road" feel. Also like your choice of white balance. Nice work.</td>', 'Really like the reflection of the woods on the side. Good angle and it conveys the "off road" feel. Also like your choice of white balance. Nice work.', '2009-05-31 14:28:21.000000', NULL, 1),
