(5506584, 793428, 100106, '<td valign="top">Love this take on the challenge. The red, white and blue is an added bonus. My family are die hard chevy fans and hands down - this would connect with them. Well done!</td>', 'Love this take on the challenge. The red, white and blue is an added bonus. My family are die hard chevy fans and hands down - this would connect with them. Well done!', '2009-05-31 14:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
