(5507189, 792087, 96881, '<td valign="top">The overdone processing of this works for some reason.  It is something that you often see with car ads, and you have pulled it off effectively with this shot.  A really professional looking submission that could easily be mistaken for something already in a magazine.  Great job</td>', 'The overdone processing of this works for some reason.  It is something that you often see with car ads, and you have pulled it off effectively with this shot.  A really professional looking submission that could easily be mistaken for something already in a magazine.  Great job', '2009-05-31 23:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5507192, 793385, 96881, '<td valign="top">Would have preferred that the car was a different colour than silver, as the overall effect here is a very grey image.  The selective desat was a great idea, and if the car was Red or something similar, this would have worked really well.  The lack of that splash of colour is what is hurting this...</td>', 'Would have preferred that the car was a different colour than silver, as the overall effect here is a very grey image.  The selective desat was a great idea, and if the car was Red or something similar, this would have worked really well.  The lack of that splash of colour is what is hurting this...', '2009-05-31 23:59:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5507195, 793289, 96881, '<td valign="top">Having the sun directly behind the car means the car is in shaddow and also quite hard to look at.  Positioning the car so the sun wasn''t in the image, but still having the yellow sky colour would ahve worked better</td>', 'Having the sun directly behind the car means the car is in shaddow and also quite hard to look at.  Positioning the car so the sun wasn''t in the image, but still having the yellow sky colour would ahve worked better', '2009-06-01 00:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5507198, 793377, 96881, '<td valign="top">Nice overall presentation of this, especially using the car colour for the border.  Good use of the shallow depth of field to remove the distracting background as well</td>', 'Nice overall presentation of this, especially using the car colour for the border.  Good use of the shallow depth of field to remove the distracting background as well', '2009-06-01 00:01:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5507200, 793299, 96881, '<td valign="top">Great car positioning in this, making the car still the subject and working well with the theme you went with.  Some additional PP work ont he coloursto make them more vibrant would also have helped.</td>', 'Great car positioning in this, making the car still the subject and working well with the theme you went with.  Some additional PP work ont he coloursto make them more vibrant would also have helped.', '2009-06-01 00:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5507201, 793329, 96881, '<td valign="top">very typical Audi, effective and well executed.  The silver rings and grill just jump out of the image.  Really well done</td>', 'very typical Audi, effective and well executed.  The silver rings and grill just jump out of the image.  Really well done', '2009-06-01 00:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5507202, 793430, 96881, '<td valign="top">Great image, but maybe having them using their other hands would be better.  That would then mean their arms were not obscuring their face, and they would have been looking slightly towards the camera, connecting better with the viewer.</td>', 'Great image, but maybe having them using their other hands would be better.  That would then mean their arms were not obscuring their face, and they would have been looking slightly towards the camera, connecting better with the viewer.', '2009-06-01 00:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5507203, 792920, 96881, '<td valign="top">Nice location.  Maybe having the colours this way was intentional, but i would prefer a much more vibrant colours in the background, rather than the washed out look</td>', 'Nice location.  Maybe having the colours this way was intentional, but i would prefer a much more vibrant colours in the background, rather than the washed out look', '2009-06-01 00:05:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5507206, 793448, 96881, '<td valign="top">Interesting image, but the wide white border doesn''t really work for me.  it seems to dominate and distract from the image.  Also would have been better if you could have found a location where the background was clear, rather than the trees, to give the image a very clean feel.</td>', 'Interesting image, but the wide white border doesn''t really work for me.  it seems to dominate and distract from the image.  Also would have been better if you could have found a location where the background was clear, rather than the trees, to give the image a very clean feel.', '2009-06-01 00:06:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5507207, 793432, 96881, '<td valign="top">Nice colours.  I know its going downhill, but I seemt o want to rotate the image.  Have you rotated this more to get the added effect?  I think some of the trees int eh background make this effect, as they don''t all appear straight</td>', 'Nice colours.  I know its going downhill, but I seemt o want to rotate the image.  Have you rotated this more to get the added effect?  I think some of the trees int eh background make this effect, as they don''t all appear straight', '2009-06-01 00:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5507210, 793438, 96881, '<td valign="top">Different, but great.  I would though have cropped different so that the headlght wasn''t in the frame, just having the paintwork and golf with the soap.</td>', 'Different, but great.  I would though have cropped different so that the headlght wasn''t in the frame, just having the paintwork and golf with the soap.', '2009-06-01 00:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5507212, 793323, 96881, '<td valign="top">Great overall composition hear.  Maybe shooting from slightly higher, just so we can see a little more of the mountains would have been better, but I love the slogan and all the overall word positions used here</td>', 'Great overall composition hear.  Maybe shooting from slightly higher, just so we can see a little more of the mountains would have been better, but I love the slogan and all the overall word positions used here', '2009-06-01 00:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5507215, 793097, 96881, '<td valign="top">A great overall image, and great colours, that fits the car exceptionally well.  Composition and presentation is spot on.  A great image.</td>', 'A great overall image, and great colours, that fits the car exceptionally well.  Composition and presentation is spot on.  A great image.', '2009-06-01 00:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5507218, 793245, 96881, '<td valign="top">Great idea, and I like the angle you have shot from.  Would have preferered the car to be by itself and not having others int he background though.  However and good use of Depth of field to blur them out.</td>', 'Great idea, and I like the angle you have shot from.  Would have preferered the car to be by itself and not having others int he background though.  However and good use of Depth of field to blur them out.', '2009-06-01 00:11:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5507221, 792987, 96881, '<td valign="top">A great image and great colours in this.  Overall image works really well.</td>', 'A great image and great colours in this.  Overall image works really well.', '2009-06-01 00:11:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5507223, 792872, 96881, '<td valign="top">Great idea and presentation.  A little extra space left on both the left and right would have made it feel a little less restricted though, and helped take the small writing off the car.</td>', 'Great idea and presentation.  A little extra space left on both the left and right would have made it feel a little less restricted though, and helped take the small writing off the car.', '2009-06-01 00:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5507225, 793380, 96881, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but a shame that the first car is not a little closer, and the line on more of an angle so that they can be seen better..........Interesting angle used.  I think it works well for this.</td>', 'Nice idea, but a shame that the first car is not a little closer, and the line on more of an angle so that they can be seen better..........Interesting angle used.  I think it works well for this.', '2009-06-01 00:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5507228, 792730, 96881, '<td valign="top">That would be nice.........Very different image that is well executed.  Classical car ad rather than the more modern ones we have seen in the rest of the challenge.</td>', 'That would be nice.........Very different image that is well executed.  Classical car ad rather than the more modern ones we have seen in the rest of the challenge.', '2009-06-01 00:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5507231, 793378, 96881, '<td valign="top">I feelt he crop is a little too tight.............An interesting angle that you shot this and it works really well for this car, emphasising the more traditional aspects of the modern Mustang.  Love the overall composition of the words and border that work well here.</td>', 'I feelt he crop is a little too tight.............An interesting angle that you shot this and it works really well for this car, emphasising the more traditional aspects of the modern Mustang.  Love the overall composition of the words and border that work well here.', '2009-06-01 00:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5507232, 793365, 96881, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but a little centred.  Some extra space ont he right for the car to ''drive'' into would have worked here.</td>', 'Nice idea, but a little centred.  Some extra space ont he right for the car to ''drive'' into would have worked here.', '2009-06-01 00:16:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5507235, 793268, 96881, '<td valign="top">Not sure on the border.  I lik the idea of having the car to the side, but cropping the edge of the car out looks awkward.  Having the extra space on the right to avoid this, and adding a little space ont eh left to balance I feel would have had the same effect without cropping the car.</td>', 'Not sure on the border.  I lik the idea of having the car to the side, but cropping the edge of the car out looks awkward.  Having the extra space on the right to avoid this, and adding a little space ont eh left to balance I feel would have had the same effect without cropping the car.', '2009-06-01 00:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5507237, 793423, 96881, '<td valign="top">Don''t know what has happened in the bottom right corner.  presenting the reflection as the top part of the photo is a different and effective choice, but the other processing artifacts in the image, especially also in the top half are a big distraction from the overall effect</td>', 'Don''t know what has happened in the bottom right corner.  presenting the reflection as the top part of the photo is a different and effective choice, but the other processing artifacts in the image, especially also in the top half are a big distraction from the overall effect', '2009-06-01 00:20:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5507239, 793424, 96881, '<td valign="top">Not really sure about the text fonts etc used here.  A nice image, but the angle/colours and composition of the image don''t help it stand out fromt eh crowd</td>', 'Not really sure about the text fonts etc used here.  A nice image, but the angle/colours and composition of the image don''t help it stand out fromt eh crowd', '2009-06-01 00:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5507240, 793292, 96881, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, but the colours seem a little washed out.  Some extra vibrance and contrast through PP would have helped this a lot.</td>', 'Nice composition, but the colours seem a little washed out.  Some extra vibrance and contrast through PP would have helped this a lot.', '2009-06-01 00:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5507241, 793169, 96881, '<td valign="top">Great colours in this image, maybe a little over the top but I think that works int eh advertising world.  All of the lines though seem to lead me away from the car. and towards the road sign.  A close crop to make the car bigger and making it the main subject would have helped.</td>', 'Great colours in this image, maybe a little over the top but I think that works int eh advertising world.  All of the lines though seem to lead me away from the car. and towards the road sign.  A close crop to make the car bigger and making it the main subject would have helped.', '2009-06-01 00:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5507242, 793123, 96881, '<td valign="top">Nice capture and nice composition for this, which matches well the theme you chose.  Great presentation here and use of the text to make a professional looking Ad.</td>', 'Nice capture and nice composition for this, which matches well the theme you chose.  Great presentation here and use of the text to make a professional looking Ad.', '2009-06-01 00:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5507243, 792692, 96881, '<td valign="top">I like the overall composition Idea, however the crop on the car just seems a little awkward to me.  Keeping a little more of the car in the shot may have helped.</td>', 'I like the overall composition Idea, however the crop on the car just seems a little awkward to me.  Keeping a little more of the car in the shot may have helped.', '2009-06-01 00:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5507244, 792280, 96881, '<td valign="top">Great overall compostion and a really professional looking submission here.  Only one small distraction/improvement.  Cloneing out (probably legal under these rules) or a slight position change to remove the structure behind the car on the right would have added to the clean image look.</td>', 'Great overall compostion and a really professional looking submission here.  Only one small distraction/improvement.  Cloneing out (probably legal under these rules) or a slight position change to remove the structure behind the car on the right would have added to the clean image look.', '2009-06-01 00:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5507245, 793392, 96881, '<td valign="top">The angle of this photo just seems a little awkward and I keep tilting my head to try and level it out........</td>', 'The angle of this photo just seems a little awkward and I keep tilting my head to try and level it out........', '2009-06-01 00:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5507248, 793295, 96881, '<td valign="top">The ront of the car really needed some additional dispersed light as it is too dark and the details can''t be seen.  Great composition though of the overall image.</td>', 'The ront of the car really needed some additional dispersed light as it is too dark and the details can''t be seen.  Great composition though of the overall image.', '2009-06-01 00:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
