(5507393, 793430, 67363, '<td valign="top">Love the feel of this and is a great image as well. Congrats</td>', 'Love the feel of this and is a great image as well. Congrats', '2009-06-01 01:25:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(5507410, 793329, 34659, '<td valign="top">Should have ribboned...  Beautiful image - congratulations.</td>', 'Should have ribboned...  Beautiful image - congratulations.', '2009-06-01 01:27:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(5507420, 792513, 39427, '<td valign="top">7.6, holy smokes Peter, congrats on the PB!... the overhead-car-pan-shot shall henceforth be known as "The Bassbone"</td>', '7.6, holy smokes Peter, congrats on the PB!... the overhead-car-pan-shot shall henceforth be known as "The Bassbone"', '2009-06-01 01:28:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(5507425, 792087, 39427, '<td valign="top">really does look like a car ad man!  congrats on breaking into the 7s and obliterating your PB, real professional shot</td>', 'really does look like a car ad man!  congrats on breaking into the 7s and obliterating your PB, real professional shot', '2009-06-01 01:29:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(5507481, 793097, 60805, '<td valign="top">Now thats a photogs ride, I prefer factory to aftermarket rims though. Well Done! :)</td>', 'Now thats a photogs ride, I prefer factory to aftermarket rims though. Well Done! :)', '2009-06-01 01:41:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(5507483, 792087, 88247, '<td valign="top">Well done Pete and congrats on 2nd place and a new PB:-)</td>', 'Well done Pete and congrats on 2nd place and a new PB:-)', '2009-06-01 01:42:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(5507516, 792513, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''ll be honest and tell you I gave it one of those 4''s. Not because I thought it was poor, because it is not. Normally I would have probably given it a 7. I was trying to understand the people who normally vote low on good entries and I was trying to vote on a scale of <i>don''t like&lt;---&gt;like</i> instead of <i>bad&lt;---&gt;good</i>. It was an interesting experiment and I gave low and mediocre votes to some killer shots, while some lesser pics that appealed to me got higher votes. This looks exactly like an ad I would see in a glossy magazine, and also one that I would turn past without a second glance. Glad to see my experiment didn''t hold it back any. I didn''t think it would.</td>', 'I''ll be honest and tell you I gave it one of those 4''s. Not because I thought it was poor, because it is not. Normally I would have probably given it a 7. I was trying to understand the people who normally vote low on good entries and I was trying to vote on a scale of don''t like<--->like instead of bad<--->good. It was an interesting experiment and I gave low and mediocre votes to some killer shots, while some lesser pics that appealed to me got higher votes. This looks exactly like an ad I would see in a glossy magazine, and also one that I would turn past without a second glance. Glad to see my experiment didn''t hold it back any. I didn''t think it would.', '2009-06-01 01:49:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(5507531, 792087, 41337, '<td valign="top">Pretty slick. The glow is so over the top but it definitely helps to make this one stand out from the pack. Since this was advance editing the clipped highlights should have been fixed and I think you missed a spot when blurring the background (i.e. near the bumper). Other than that very professional. Congrats.</td>', 'Pretty slick. The glow is so over the top but it definitely helps to make this one stand out from the pack. Since this was advance editing the clipped highlights should have been fixed and I think you missed a spot when blurring the background (i.e. near the bumper). Other than that very professional. Congrats.', '2009-06-01 01:52:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(5507572, 792513, 32872, '<td valign="top">I love this professional looking  image that would look beautiful in any high-end magazine!  Congratulations on winning a blue.  Thanks for sharing your editing techniques, too!!</td>', 'I love this professional looking  image that would look beautiful in any high-end magazine!  Congratulations on winning a blue.  Thanks for sharing your editing techniques, too!!', '2009-06-01 02:10:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(5507576, 792087, 32872, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your red ribbon!!  This is a super, stunning image.</td>', 'Congratulations on your red ribbon!!  This is a super, stunning image.', '2009-06-01 02:13:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(5507582, 793426, 67145, '<td valign="top">many congrats on a superb image and a HM .. <br/>if i had the money this would convince me to buy one .. !!!!! ..<br/>brilliant photograph .. :)</td>', 'many congrats on a superb image and a HM .. if i had the money this would convince me to buy one .. !!!!! ..brilliant photograph .. :)', '2009-06-01 02:16:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(5507584, 792513, 52549, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on winning and on your new PB. A fantastic image and a killer score.</td>', 'Congratulations on winning and on your new PB. A fantastic image and a killer score.', '2009-06-01 02:16:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(5507589, 792513, 67145, '<td valign="top">WOW .. !!!!!!!! .. this is just TOO GOOD .. !!!<br/>you''ve taken the most amazing photograph .. i can feel the motion .. insane . !!<br/>everything is perfect .. <br/>your text is inspired .. excellent font and size &amp; its the placement ..  <br/>oh .. CONGRATS ON THE BLUE AND AN AMAZING SCORE ..:)</td>', 'WOW .. !!!!!!!! .. this is just TOO GOOD .. !!!you''ve taken the most amazing photograph .. i can feel the motion .. insane . !!everything is perfect .. your text is inspired .. excellent font and size & its the placement ..  oh .. CONGRATS ON THE BLUE AND AN AMAZING SCORE ..:)', '2009-06-01 02:20:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(5507592, 792087, 52549, '<td valign="top">Wow! A stunning image, Peter. Congrats on your ribbon and new PB.</td>', 'Wow! A stunning image, Peter. Congrats on your ribbon and new PB.', '2009-06-01 02:22:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(5507593, 793082, 52549, '<td valign="top">Excellent image, beautiful car. Congrats on the ribbon, Philip.</td>', 'Excellent image, beautiful car. Congrats on the ribbon, Philip.', '2009-06-01 02:23:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(5507607, 793335, 58452, '<td valign="top">Weren''t you complaining some time ago that you never get brown ribbons........</td>', 'Weren''t you complaining some time ago that you never get brown ribbons........', '2009-06-01 02:37:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(5507612, 792087, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very professional!  Nothing needs to be done to this at all to be an actual car ad.  You should take a print to the dealer where you shot this!  Oh, and congrats on the ribbon and the new PB!</td>', 'Very professional!  Nothing needs to be done to this at all to be an actual car ad.  You should take a print to the dealer where you shot this!  Oh, and congrats on the ribbon and the new PB!', '2009-06-01 02:40:20.000000', NULL, 0),
