(5507616, 792513, 30982, '<td valign="top">Ah, if only I could remake a few of mine and ribbon with ''em...  :-)  Looks like it is indeed a fun shot to get - and that''s more than half the joy of it, isn''t it?  Congrats!</td>', 'Ah, if only I could remake a few of mine and ribbon with ''em...  :-)  Looks like it is indeed a fun shot to get - and that''s more than half the joy of it, isn''t it?  Congrats!', '2009-06-01 02:42:08.000000', NULL, 0),
